Package: cdiscdata
Title: Versioned CDISC Standards Reference Data
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Bill", "Denney", email = "wdenney@humanpredictions.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-5759-428X")),
    person("Clinical Data Interchange Standards Consortium (CDISC)", role = "cph",
           comment = "Define-XML schema files in inst/extdata/schema (MIT License)"),
    person("Lex", "Jansen", role = "cph",
           comment = "Define-XML stylesheets in inst/extdata/stylesheet (MIT License)"),
    person("National Cancer Institute Enterprise Vocabulary Services", role = "dtc",
           comment = "CDISC Controlled Terminology (public domain)"))
Description: Provides versioned CDISC Controlled Terminology (SDTM, ADaM),
    SDTM Model/SDTMIG and ADaMIG implementation-guide variable metadata,
    and Define-XML schemas (XSD) and CDISC XSLT stylesheets. Uses a
    validity-date design to store all historical CT versions compactly
    without redundant row duplication. Intended as a shared data
    dependency for pharmaverse-aligned packages.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
